; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-point-evaluation.py; checked native terms.
; Prove the actual coordinate
; evaluation kernel equals XYIdeal, with both membership maps
; constructed in native Lim. This is the point-evaluation kernel
; prerequisite for the source quotient isomorphism, not yet the
; quotient isomorphism, dimensions, class group, or full point group.
(#alias commutative-ring = ./commutative-ring-data.lim::commutative-ring)
